# Prompts: Default

Purpose:
  Prompt intelligence engine. Converts simple human prompts into
  architecture docs and executable .sdd/project/ structure.
  Raw prompts are read from root prompts/ inbox, analyzed,
  formalized into .sdd/projects/prompts/, and documented
  in .sdd/projects/sddra.ai/docs/prompts/ for human review.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @prompts.sdd
   3 @tech-stack/INDEX.sdd
   4 @role-assignment/INDEX.sdd
   5 @provisioning/INDEX.sdd

Modes:
  ANALYZE   — analyze incoming prompt from root prompts/
  GENERATE  — generate docs from prompt
  CONVERT   — convert docs to .sdd/project/
  EXECUTE   — execute .sdd/project/
  REVIEW    — human review gate

Rules:
  [P1]  Every prompt MUST be analyzed before execution.
  [P2]  AI MUST check existing prompt knowledge before processing new prompt.
  [P3]  A prompt MUST be compared against existing project knowledge.
  [P4]  Prompts MUST be archived, not deleted.
  [P5]  Prompts MUST be categorized by domain.
  [P6]  Tech stack prompts MUST resolve to skill paths.
  [P7]  Role assignment prompts MUST require human approval.
  [P8]  Provisioning prompts MUST only execute after approval.
  [P9]  Docs MUST be generated in simple English.
  [P10] .sdd/project/ MUST be generated only after human approval.
  [P11] Formalized prompts MUST live in .sdd/projects/prompts/.
  [P12] Documented prompts with IDs MUST live in .sdd/projects/sddra.ai/docs/prompts/.
  [P13] Root prompts/ is the user inbox only — no .sdd metadata there.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    prompts.sdd

  Resolve:
    tech-stack
    role-assignment
    provisioning

Navigation:
  Prompts: @prompts/INDEX.sdd
  TechStack: @prompts/tech-stack/INDEX.sdd
  RoleAssignment: @prompts/role-assignment/INDEX.sdd
  Provisioning: @prompts/provisioning/INDEX.sdd
  RootPrompts: @../../prompts/README.md
  RootPromptsInbox: @../../prompts/inbox/
  RootPromptsActive: @../../prompts/active/
  RootPromptsArchive: @../../prompts/archive/
  ProjectsPrompts: @../projects/prompts/INDEX.sdd
  PromptDocs: @../../projects/sddra.ai/docs/prompts/

State: +
